<title>HONG KONG: Trading in China Strategic suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in China Strategic suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Strategic Holdings Ltd was suspended on Monday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of China Strategic were untraded at HK$3.50 each at midday.</p>
<p>China Strategic is an investment holding company with interest in restaurant operation and property investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
